  <caption>Profile quick reference</caption>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Profile<th>What it adds<th>When to claim
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>`acs-core`
      <td>Handshake, envelope, hook taxonomy, dispositions, SessionContext and published
          chain head, replay protection, baseline signature (HMAC-SHA256), decision
          honoring, ping
      <td>Always (mandatory)
    <tr>
      <td>`acs-trace`
      <td>OTel and OCSF event emission per step
      <td>Cross-vendor observability or SIEM integration
    <tr>
      <td>`acs-inspect`
      <td>`agbom/snapshot` and canonical AgBOM serialization
      <td>Policy depends on component inventory
    <tr>
      <td>`acs-inspect-dynamic`
      <td>`agbom/changed` on mutation
      <td>Agent hot-swaps components mid-session
    <tr>
      <td>`acs-provenance`
      <td>Field-level Provenance objects
      <td>Enforcing FIDES, CaMeL, or AARM-style information-flow paradigms
    <tr>
      <td>`acs-crypto`
      <td>ML-DSA-65 / SLH-DSA-128s signatures
      <td>Cryptographic integrity beyond shared-secret HMAC
    <tr>
      <td>`acs-audit`
      <td>`request_hash` on every ContextEntry
      <td>Chain must commit to request content
</table>
